{"version":3,"pageFormat":"notebook-900x1200-v1","id":"01822181-57b8-4ebd-8b20-eebe43b8e9cd","title":"webs ","created":"2026-10-14T21:30:09.280Z","music":{"artists":[{"name":"brakence","url":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4kqFrZkeqDfOIEqTWqbOOV"},{"name":"glaive","url":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4cJKDGSv4Dz9QycXYmo565"},{"name":"pnkdrco","url":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/54ui5N3fVlyC2imsAakAhI"}],"songs":[{"name":"Problem Child - brakence","url":"https://open.spotify.com/track/6jpiquknSI0v7bMTYwSaqx"},{"name":"living proof (that it hurts) - glaive","url":"https://open.spotify.com/track/23wMeomYG5labWnSVNFv2z"},{"name":"savior - pnkdrco","url":"https://open.spotify.com/track/24VOlv4NK2KurHMEab4ZRg"}]},"pages":[{"id":"b9c8e764-0747-4f6b-aeb9-db30dd126cd9","elements":[{"id":"e25fdec9-5c87-4c5a-949c-fd4abf0a0abb","type":"text","x":14.666748046875,"y":37.33331298828125,"w":744.0001220703125,"h":142.6667022705078,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"grass flickers without worry and i am still in the same desperate corner. pleas getting stuck in the cobwebs as the spiders dance down from the ceiling, pirouetting until it meets my eyes. they seem to have been dancing for so long that i think they have forgotten there was ever music. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":32,"fixedHeight":true},{"id":"4090b176-e7f5-408d-9397-63bd23ccabad","type":"text","x":0,"y":194.6666717529297,"w":783.9998779296875,"h":185.3331756591797,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"everyone wants something from me, but all they get is a mess. i keep handing them handfuls of tangled string and calling it an answer. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"here— ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"take this. make something out of it. make it into a rope. make it into a ladder. make it into a noose. make it into anything that might finally get me somewhere. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"but the string only knots itself tighter. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it should’ve reached some sort of climax by now. i should’ve blown up my life. it should’ve taken me with it. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":14,"fixedHeight":true},{"id":"ce914361-8e5b-4706-81bc-a8dcce399535","type":"text","x":1.3333740234375,"y":394.666748046875,"w":778.666748046875,"h":525.333251953125,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"i should’ve concluded the historic battle by now, but apparently the armies have misplaced their maps. the horses have wandered off. the swords are rusting in the mud and everyone keeps insisting the war is happening. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i keep waking up in the same fields with the same dirt in my mouth. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the flags are still waving. the dead keep getting back up. the sun keeps rising over a battlefield that has long forgotten what it was fighting for. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it should’ve stopped repeating itself but it doesn’t. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i keep walking in circles and calling it progress. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i keep changing the scenery and pretending i have escaped. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"look! a different tree! a different cloud! a different crack in the pavement! ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"surely this must be somewhere else. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"surely i must be someone else. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"but then i look down— there i am. same shoes. same feet. same stupid shadow following three steps behind me like it knows the joke. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i heed no warnings, ran the stop signs, blabbed my mouth my mouth like a cannon, and shot bombs when there was no threat. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i have always been good at declaring war on things that were not attacking me. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"a bird lands on the fence and i prepare for a siege.","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"a door creaks and i sharpen my knives. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"someone goes quiet and i build a whole funeral around it. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i have buried entire kingdoms because somebody took too long to answer me. then i stand in the rubble and wonder why everything is so quiet. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":15,"fixedHeight":true}]},{"id":"0bed5876-2009-4d64-9e28-5e7754fa1946","elements":[{"id":"a6742678-241b-48cf-9758-557e2433c334","type":"photo","x":7.668026387691384,"y":89.33331298828125,"w":770.9985995888711,"h":925.5598663294302,"rotation":0,"src":"media/3b19be75c80699d3f10c2d4e09d56934e2c439db.png","alt":""},{"id":"f410e869-0e5b-4028-9fc8-315ef6157434","type":"text","x":306.6668701171875,"y":966.6666870117188,"w":183.9998779296875,"h":48,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"i always feel so scared.","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#FFFFFF"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":15,"fixedHeight":true}]},{"id":"1fac2c12-6838-4f1f-ace9-adeda60eec21","elements":[{"id":"bad380cc-9111-4542-a155-92f6543594ab","type":"text","x":3.999755859375,"y":25.166763305664062,"w":780.0003662109375,"h":394.66693115234375,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"there! ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the little truth. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the mouse beneath the floorboards. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the tiny wet thing chewing holes through my chest.","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i carry it everywhere. it rides in my pockets. it sleeps under my tongue. sometimes it climbs into my throat and refuses to come down. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i tell it there is nothing to be afraid of. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it laughs. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i tell it we are safe. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it laughs harder. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i tell it to shut up. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it starts screaming. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"so i keep running. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"that is what i do. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i move. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i run. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i stumble. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i turn around. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. i don’t stop running. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"somehow the world keeps putting the same corner in front of me. the corner has become very familiar. sometimes i think the corner knows me too. i think it waits for me. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":15,"fixedHeight":true},{"id":"5782d834-7553-4bac-94e7-a7ca637ff9a2","type":"text","x":0,"y":437.1665802001953,"w":786.6666259765625,"h":68,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i sit down. i watch the spiders. they are much much better at this than i. they know how to wait. they know how to build something delicate and then abandon it without any concern. they know when it's finished. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":14,"fixedHeight":true},{"id":"8602d8ba-f658-4a65-b726-c2bfaf23eb6e","type":"text","x":1.3333740234375,"y":527.8334503173828,"w":778.666748046875,"h":538.6666564941406,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"i don’t. i keep adding.","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"another thought. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"another fear. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"another promise. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"another apology. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"another reason. another reason. another reason. another reason. another reason. another reason. another reason. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"until the whole thing is so thick i cannot see through it. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"maybe i have mistaken accumulation for living. i collect days. i collect mistakes. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i collect little moments that should have meant nothing and polish them until they become enormous. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i keep them in my pockets. they weigh me down. i tell everyone i am fine. i say it so often that the word has started to taste like pennies. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine fine","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"what a strange word. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"four letters pretending to be a life raft. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i am not fine. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i am a person-shaped bucket with a hole in the bottom. everything anyone pours into me leaks straight through. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"love. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"anger. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"kindness. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"fear. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i hold none of it for very long. i just leave a trail behind me. a wet little path of everything i could not keep. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":15,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":14,"fixedHeight":true}]},{"id":"8f79b6d1-55c0-4a7a-9aa0-e479ab991775","elements":[{"id":"66412707-7b9c-42d4-adbd-4ddcbf05f128","type":"text","x":0,"y":3.999969482421875,"w":791.9998779296875,"h":1065.333251953125,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"everyone keeps pouring. everyone wants something from me. all i can give them is a mess. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i want to arrive with my hands clean. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i really do. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i want to have a neat little explanation tied around my neck like a ribbon. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"this is why i am like this. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"this is what happened. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"this is how it ends. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"but there is none. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"no ribbon. no explanation. just the knot. the knot!","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the knot. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"am i waiting for disaster? at least that would be an ending. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"something loud enough to point at. something large enough to blame. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"something with a beginning, a middle, and a glorious, glorious, horrible end. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"instead i have this: ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"a battlefield where nobody wins because nobody remembers how to stop fighting. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i am exhausted. my nightmares have become bored. the monsters come into my dreams dragging their little claws behind them. they yawn. they look embarrassed. they apologize. they say they will try again tomorrow. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"even fear is getting tired of me.","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"still, i wake up frightened. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"still, i check the doors. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"still, i listen to footsteps that will never come. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"still, i prepare for the sky to fall. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it never does.  the sky just hangs there. blue and enormous and completely uninterested. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i hate it for that. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i love it for that. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"sometimes i want to climb into and disappear between the clouds. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"sometimes i want to drag it down and make it look at me. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"look at me. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"look at what you made me do.","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"look at this stupid little creature trying to carry an entire life in its mouth. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"look at how it keeps dropping everything. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"look at how it keeps picking everything back up. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i stand up. the room tilts. i stand still until it stops. nothing happens. no revelation. no miracle. no great hand reaching down from the sky to pluck me out of myself. just the floor beneath my feet. just the walls. just the door. just me. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":15,"fixedHeight":true},{"id":"844f1830-a505-41cb-8b2c-a6ba67cbb5f3","type":"photo","x":712,"y":986.6666666666667,"w":80,"h":93.33333333333333,"rotation":0,"src":"media/d704aebfa69923d425706bcce55a762114ab3025.png","alt":"Pixel tooth impression"}]}],"status":"published","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T17:28:47.014Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T17:37:31.615Z","updatedBy":342274735}